// ## 1. Per-pass verdict

// | Pass | Verdict | Note |
// |------|---------|------|
// | 0 Pre-flight | WIP | 1 dirty (this audit dir). Last commit 020693a 2026-09-11 — removed LLM-harness scanning/wiring. |
// | 1 File law | PASS | All 7 .sh match §1.14 carve-outs (install.sh, */profile.d.sh, tests/test_*.sh, tests/*_inner.sh). harness_wire.oo loose but headed. 3 ANCHOR.oo ALLCAPS. |
